// Writes the menu of the application launcher of hd-desktop again, with hd-launcher, each time apt
// has run dpkg: after an installation, an upgrade or a removal. A failure is reported but does not
// fail apt, as the packages are installed by then. The check for hd-launcher keeps this file from
// failing after hd-desktop is removed and before it is purged.
DPkg::Post-Invoke {
    "if [ -x /usr/sbin/hd-launcher ]; then if ! /usr/sbin/hd-launcher; then echo 'hd-launcher: could not write the menu of the launcher.' >&2; fi; fi";
};
